  "content": "\n\n<p>《風之法典》為 Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks 引入了嶄新的「風」學派</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>特色：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>7 項可升級的新法術</li>\n<li>1 套全新法師護甲</li>\n<li>1 種新結構「風車」</li>\n<li>1 種新施法者「風法師」</li>\n<li>1 件新法杖 &amp; 法典</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4c32775e1dff756dc78bbe98f49236164d2cf829.png\" alt=\"探索全新的風學派\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f079b3d71b71bce28b6d50586fd0c1e4886597a1.jpeg\" alt=\"探索新結構\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2dd7abf5be7c74aa6f369b22465018b076c3cf10.jpeg\" alt=\"遇見風法師\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/855d385f8ef0faf4687df4036b4b9f648cff2e5c.jpeg\" alt=\"體驗強力的新法術\"></p>",
